---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2026-09-06';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How PetWellHub handles visitor information, cookies, analytics, advertising, and privacy requests">
  <article class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24">
    <header class="mb-12 border-b border-border pb-8"><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent">Legal · Privacy</p><h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-bold md:text-7xl">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p></header>
    <div class="prose-article space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.75]">
      <section><h2>1. Scope</h2><p>This policy explains how PetWellHub may process information when you visit petwellhub.org or contact the editorial address. The site does not offer user accounts or request pet medical records through a portal.</p></section>
      <section><h2>2. Information that may be processed</h2><p>Hosting, security, analytics, and advertising providers may process device and request data such as IP address, browser type, operating system, requested page, referring page, timestamp, cookie identifiers, and approximate location. If you email us, we receive the address, message, and attachments you choose to send.</p></section>
      <section><h2>3. Purposes</h2><p>Information may be used to deliver and secure the site, diagnose technical failures, understand aggregate readership, prevent abuse, respond to requests, and display or measure advertising when those services are enabled.</p></section>
      <section><h2>4. Service providers</h2><p>PetWellHub may use Cloudflare for delivery and security and Google services for analytics or advertising. Each provider processes information under its own terms and privacy policy. Google advertising controls are available through <a class="underline" href="https://myadcenter.google.com/">My Ad Center</a>.</p></section>
      <section><h2>5. Cookies and choices</h2><p>Browser controls can block or delete cookies. Blocking some storage may affect preferences or measurement. See the <a class="underline" href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a> for categories and controls.</p></section>
      <section><h2>6. Retention and disclosure</h2><p>Email is retained only as needed to handle the request and maintain appropriate records. Service-provider retention follows provider settings and legal obligations. Information may be disclosed when required by law, to protect the site, or to investigate abuse; PetWellHub does not sell veterinary histories or account profiles.</p></section>
      <section><h2>7. Children and sensitive information</h2><p>The site is directed to adult pet caregivers and does not knowingly solicit personal information from children. Do not email payment-card numbers, passwords, government identifiers, or unnecessary medical records.</p></section>
      <section><h2>8. Requests and updates</h2><p>To ask about access, correction, deletion, or this policy, email <a class="underline" href="mailto:editor@petwellhub.org">editor@petwellhub.org</a>. Applicable rights vary by location. Material policy changes will be posted here with a revised date.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
